msgstr "Agnosis vereist WordPress %s of hoger."

#. translators: 1: required Lingua Forge version, 2: currently installed Lingua Forge version
#: agnosis.php:155
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Agnosis is written against Lingua Forge %1$s or newer; this site has %2$s. "
"Agnosis keeps working — features that need the newer version simply stay "
"inactive, currently the artist-subdomain entries in the multilingual "
"sitemap. Updating Lingua Forge enables them."
msgstr "Agnosis is geschreven tegen Lingua Forge %1$s of nieuwer; deze site heeft %2$s. Agnosis blijft werken — functies die de nieuwere versie nodig hebben blijven momenteel inactief, waaronder de kunstenaar-subdomeinvermeldingen in de meertalige sitemap. Het bijwerken van Lingua Forge stelt ze in staat."

