#: blocks/site-copyright/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Site Copyright"
msgstr "Site Auteursrecht"

#: blocks/site-copyright/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Footer copyright line — \"© {year} Agnosis (@agnosis@host)\" on the main "
"site, \"© {year} {Artist Name} (@artistname@host)\" on an artist's own "
"subdomain — the parenthetical is always that actor's real Fediverse handle, "
"so a visitor always has a copyable handle to follow from their own Fediverse "
"client."
msgstr ""
"Footer auteursrechtlijn — \"© {year} Agnosis (@agnosis@host)\" op de "
"hoofdsite, \"© {year} {Artist Name} (@artistname@host)\" op de eigen "
"subdomein van de artiest — de haakjes bevatten altijd dat acteur's echte "
"Fediverse handle, zodat een bezoeker altijd een kopieerbare handle heeft om "
"te volgen vanuit hun eigen Fediverse-client."

#: blocks/site-copyright/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "handle"
msgstr "handle"

#: blocks/submissions/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "My Submissions"
msgstr "Mijn inzendingen"

#: blocks/submissions/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Lists the logged-in artist's pending artwork submissions for review and "
"approval. Place this on your /my-submissions/ page or in a Site Editor "
"template."
msgstr ""
"Toont de openstaande kunstwerkinzendingen van de ingelogde artiest voor "
"beoordeling en goedkeuring. Plaats dit op je /my-submissions/-pagina of in "
"een Site Editor-template."

